            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="case-card-content">
          <p class="case-card-meta">
            <span class="case-card-client">Kraken · Cryptowatch</span>
            <span class="case-card-period">Aug 2020 — Nov 2022</span>
          </p>
          <h3 class="case-card-headline">
            Rebuilt a crypto trading-automation tool.
          </h3>
          <p class="case-card-body">
            Cryptowatch served millions of traders across 25 exchanges and 4,000+ markets.
            I took over Coderunner from another engineer and rebuilt its frontend — replacing
            JSON-schema forms with a custom form generator, working alongside a backend dev.
            Also shipped the multi-exchange trading form, cockpit redesign, and leverage slider
