          <p class="case-card-meta">
            <span class="case-card-client">Xapo</span>
            <span class="case-card-period">Nov 2017 — Apr 2020</span>
          </p>
          <h3 class="case-card-headline">
            At the forefront of Bitcoin wallet tech — back in 2017.
          </h3>
          <p class="case-card-body">
            At a Bitcoin custody company serving 1.5M+ customers, I designed the full-stack
            React, Next.js and Express blueprint adopted as the company standard, and built
            CI/CD and E2E testing from the ground up. Completed private blockchain training
            with Andreas Antonopoulos and Jimmy Song.
          </p>
