            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="case-card" data-reveal>
          <div class="case-card-visual">
            <img src="/img/og.png" alt="petewatters.ie — this portfolio site" width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="case-card-content">
            <p class="case-card-meta">
              <span class="case-card-client">Independent · petewatters.ie</span>
              <span class="case-card-period">2026</span>
            </p>
            <h3 class="case-card-headline">This site — an Astro PWA with build-time on-chain data.</h3>
            <p class="case-card-body">
